("note", "DEFINITION", "**Acid:** produces **H<sup>+</sup> (hydrogen) ions** in water. **Base:** produces **OH<sup>&minus;</sup> (hydroxide) ions** in water. A base that dissolves in water is an **alkali** (NaOH, KOH, Ca(OH)<sub>2</sub>)."),
